hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1447","Ahmad bin Abdah narrated to us, Hafs narrated to us, meaning Ibn Juma’ al-Ijli, Samak bin Harb narrated to us, on the authority of Jabir bin Samurah al-Sawai’i, he said: I heard him say: I saw the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, giving the sermon on Friday standing, then sitting down and not speaking, then getting up and giving the sermon. Another sermon. Whoever tells you that he saw the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, giving the sermon while sitting, has lied.”"
